---

<StaticPage
	title="Disclosure"
	description="HomelyFusion's affiliate, advertising, and sponsored content disclosure, including our Amazon Associates disclosure."
	icon="💰"
>
	<p class="updated" style="margin-top:-1rem;">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

	<p>
		HomelyFusion is a for-profit website. This page explains how we earn income so you can make informed
		decisions when you read our content and use our links.
	</p>

	<h2>Amazon Associates disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		HomelyFusion is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program
		designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and
		affiliated sites.
	</p>
	<div class="note-box">
		<span class="note-icon">💵</span>
		<span>
			<strong>As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.</strong> This means that if you click a
			link to Amazon from this Site and make a purchase, we may receive a small commission—at no additional cost
			to you.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Other affiliate relationships</h2>
	<p>
		Some links on our website are affiliate links, meaning we may earn a commission if you purchase a product or
		service through them—<strong>at no extra cost to you</strong>. In addition to Amazon, the affiliate programs
		we participate in include:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>CJ Affiliate</li>
		<li>ShareASale</li>
		<li>PartnerStack</li>
		<li>Impact</li>
		<li>Other home-related affiliate networks</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		Our recommendations are based on genuine research, experience, or editorial discretion. These links do not
		change your price or your shopping experience.
	</p>

	<h2>Sponsored content</h2>
	<p>
		We may publish sponsored content or work with product partners. Sponsored partners are clearly labeled in our
		content.
	</p>

	<h2>Advertising disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		We display third-party advertisements, which may come from networks such as Google AdSense or Mediavine.
		These ads may use cookies and tracking to serve relevant ads based on your interests. We strive to partner
		only with advertisers that align with our values in home decor, minimalism, and eco-conscious living. For more
		on cookies, see our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Product reviews and recommendations</h2>
	<p>
		We offer reviews and recommendations on home decor items, minimalist accessories, lighting, and eco-friendly
		decor brands. These opinions are our own and may be influenced by personal use, research, or affiliate
		relationships.
	</p>

	<h2>We don't sell products</h2>
	<p>
		HomelyFusion does not manufacture or sell any physical products directly. All purchases made through
		third-party links are governed by the terms and return policies of the respective sellers. Please read the
		merchant's policies before making a purchase.
	</p>

	<h2>External links</h2>
	<p>
		Our content may link to third-party websites, including affiliate partners, blogs, and retailers. We do not
		control or endorse their content, services, or privacy practices. See our
		<a href="/terms/">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> for details.
	</p>

	<h2>Informational purposes only</h2>
	<div class="note-box warm">
		<span class="note-icon">ℹ️</span>
		<span>
			All content on HomelyFusion is provided for <strong>informational and educational purposes only</strong>.
			We make no guarantees about the completeness of the information or the results of using our
			recommendations.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Questions</h2>
	<p>If you have questions about this disclosure, please reach out through our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
</StaticPage>
